      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3609,
      "text": "Those who disbelieve say, “The Hour will not come to us.” Say, “Yes, by my Lord, it will surely come to you.” [He is] the Knower of the unseen; not even an atom’s weight[1] is hidden from Him in the heavens or on earth, nor is there anything smaller or bigger than that, except that it is in a clear Record[2],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 34,
        "name": "سُورَةُ سَبَإٍ",
        "englishName": "Saba",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Sheba",
        "numberOfAyahs": 54,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 22,
      "manzil": 5,
      "page": 428,
      "ruku": 370,
      "hizbQuarter": 171,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3610,
      "text": "so that He may reward those who believe and do righteous deeds; it is they who will have forgiveness and a generous provision.",
      "surah": {
